xt/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flib.jpe&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/><img alt=\"Library background Mobile\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"block md:hidden object-cover object-center opacity-25\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flib.jpe&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flib.jpe&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flib.jpe&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flib.jpe&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flib.jpe&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flib.jpe&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flib.jpe&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flib.jpe&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flib.jpe&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-linear-to-r from-[#132821] via-[#1E3E34]/90 to-transparent\"></div></div><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 sm:px-10 lg:px-12 py-16 sm:py-20 relative z-10 w-full\"><nav class=\"flex text-xs text-[#C5A059] mb-6 font-medium tracking-wide\"><span class=\"hover:underline opacity-80 cursor-pointer\">Home</span><span class=\"mx-2\">&gt;</span><span class=\"text-white/90\">Admissions</span></nav><div class=\"flex items-center space-x-3 mb-4\"><span class=\"h-px w-8 bg-[#C5A059]\"></span><span class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#C5A059] font-semibold\">JOIN OUR SCHOLARLY COMMUNITY</span></div><h1 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-serif font-normal tracking-tight text-white max-w-4xl leading-tight mb-6\">Academic programmes, fellowships and scholarly opportunities</h1><p class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm sm:text-base max-w-2xl font-light mb-10 leading-relaxed\">A dynamic portal for programmes, fellowships, internships, online study and scholarships, with eligibility, fees, documents and online applications.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-4\"><a href=\"#apply\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3.5 bg-[#21674E] hover:bg-[#1B543F] text-white text-sm font-medium rounded transition-colors duration-200\">Start Application<svg class=\"w-4 h-4 ml-2\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 bg-white\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"mb-12\"><div class=\"flex items-center space-x-3 mb-2\"><span class=\"h-px w-8 bg-[#C5A059]\"></span><span class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#C5A059] font-semibold\">PROGRAMS</span></div><h2 class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif font-normal text-[#1E3E34] mb-4\">Academic Programs &amp; Pathways</h2><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm sm:text-base max-w-3xl font-light\">Discover rigorous educational structures designed to deepen your understanding of Qur&#x27;anic sciences, classical exegesis, and linguistic lineages.</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\"><div class=\"border border-gray-200 rounded-lg p-5 flex space-x-4 bg-white hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\"><div class=\"relative w-24 h-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded\"><img alt=\"Academic Programs\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"hidden md:block object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flib.jpe&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flib.jpe&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flib.jpe&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flib.jpe&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flib.jpe&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flib.jpe&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flib.jpe&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flib.jpe&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flib.jpe&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/><img alt=\"Academic Programs\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"block md:hidden object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flib.jpe&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flib.jpe&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flib.jpe&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flib.jpe&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flib.jpe&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flib.jpe&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flib.jpe&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flib.jpe&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flib.jpe&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div><div class=\"flex flex-col justify-between\"><div><span class=\"text-[10px] font-bold tracking-wider text-[#C5A059] uppercase block mb-1\">ADMISSIONS OPEN</span><h3 class=\"text-lg font-serif text-[#1E3E34] font-medium mb-1\">Academic Programs</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-[#1E3E34]/80 font-serif mb-2\" dir=\"rtl\">البرامج الأكاديمية</p><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 line-clamp-3 leading-relaxed\">Full-time scholarly research tracks focused on historical context, hermeneutical studies, and theology.</p></div><a href=\"#apply\" class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-[#1E3E34] hover:underline inline-flex items-center mt-3\">Apply Now <span class=\"ml-1\">→</span></a></div></div><div class=\"border border-gray-200 rounded-lg p-5 flex space-x-4 bg-white hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\"><div class=\"relative w-24 h-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded\"><img alt=\"Certificate Programs\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"hidden md:block object-cover\" style