r&#x27;an and early manuscript studies.</p></div><a href=\"#apply\" class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-[#1E3E34] hover:underline inline-flex items-center mt-3\">Apply Now <span class=\"ml-1\">→</span></a></div></div><div class=\"border border-gray-200 rounded-lg p-5 flex space-x-4 bg-white hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\"><div class=\"relative w-24 h-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded\"><img alt=\"Diploma Programs\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"hidden md:block object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flib.jpe&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flib.jpe&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flib.jpe&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flib.jpe&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flib.jpe&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flib.jpe&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flib.jpe&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flib.jpe&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flib.jpe&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/><img alt=\"Diploma Programs\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"block md:hidden object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flib.jpe&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flib.jpe&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flib.jpe&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flib.jpe&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flib.jpe&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flib.jpe&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flib.jpe&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flib.jpe&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimag