\",\\\"Admissions\\\"],\\\"tagline\\\":\\\"JOIN OUR SCHOLARLY COMMUNITY\\\",\\\"headline\\\":\\\"Academic programmes, fellowships and scholarly opportunities\\\",\\\"subheading\\\":\\\"A dynamic portal for programmes, fellowships, internships, online study and scholarships, with eligibility, fees, documents and online applications.\\\",\\\"bgImage\\\":\\\"/images/lib.jpe\\\",\\\"bgImageMobile\\\":\\\"/images/lib.jpe\\\"},\\\"programs\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"academic-programs\\\",\\\"image\\\":\\\"/images/lib.jpe\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Academic Programs\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"ADMISSIONS OPEN\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Full-time scholarly research tracks focused on historical context, hermeneutical studies, and theology.\\\",\\\"imageMobile\\\":\\\"/images/lib.jpe\\\",\\\"titleArabic\\\":\\\"البرامج الأكاديمية\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"certificate-programs\\\",\\\"image\\\":\\\"/images/lib.jpe\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Certificate Programs\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"ADMISSIONS OPEN\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Short-term intensive courses targeting specialized elements within Ulum al-Qur'an and early manuscript studies.\\\",\\\"imageMobile\\\":\\\"/images/lib.jpe\\\",\\\"titleArabic\\\":\\\"برامج الشهادات\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"diploma-programs\\\",\\\"image\\\":\\\"/images/lib.jpe\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Diploma Programs\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"ADMISSIONS OPEN\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Comprehensive part-time study paths designed for working professionals seeking advanced accreditation.\\\",\\\"imageMobile\\\":\\\"/images/lib.jpe\\\",\\\"titleArabic\\\":\\\"برامج الدبلوم\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"research-fellowships\\\",\\\"image\\\":\\\"/images/lib.jpe\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Research Fellowships\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"ADMISSIONS OPEN\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Funded opportunities for senior post-doctoral scholars to publish innovative Tafsir methodologies.\\\",\\\"imageMobile\\\":\\\"/images/lib.jpe\\\",\\\"titleArabic\\\":\\\"الزمالات البحثية\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"visiting-scholars\\\",\\\"image\\\":\\\"/images/lib.jpe\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Visiting Scholars\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"ADMISSIONS OPEN\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Collaborative residential frameworks for international academics conducting comparative research.\\\",\\\"imageMobile\\\":\\\"/images/lib.jpe\\\",\\\"titleArabic\\\":\\\"العلماء الزائرون\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"research-internships\\\",\\\"image\\\":\\\"/images/lib.jpe\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Research Internships\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"ADMISSIONS OPEN\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Hands-on assistantships paired directly with leading faculty on ongoing digital database indexing.\\\",\\\"imageMobile\\\":\\\"/images/lib.jpe\\\",\\\"titleArabic\\\":\\\"التدريب البحثي\\\"}],\\\"featuredProgram\\\":{\\\"limit\\\":\\\"25 Scholars Max\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Master of Qur'anic Sciences\\\",\\\"tagline\\\":\\\"FEATURED PROGRAM\\\",\\\"duration\\\":\\\"2 Academic Years\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"A premier graduate program exploring the hermeneutics of classical commentary, early manuscripts palaeography, and linguistic systems.\\\",\\\"limitDetails\\\":\\\"Maintained tightly for high-fidelity seminar supervision.\\\",\\\"prerequisite\\\":\\\"Bachelor's Degree\\\",\\\"durationDetails\\\":\\\"Four full terms including a compulsory thesis submission.\\\",\\\"prerequisiteDetails\\\":\\\"Islamic Studies, Arabic Grammar, or certified equivalent required.\\\"},\\\"requirements\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"req-1\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Official Transcripts\\\",\\\"number\\\":\\\"01\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Degree sheets and official seals of previous universities, with accredited Arabic or English translations.\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"req-2\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Identifications (ID/Passport)\\\",\\\"number\\\":\\\"02\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"A valid national identification document or passport copy with clear details and photograph.\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"req-3\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Language Proficiency\\\",\\\"number\\\":\\\"03\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Demonstrated fluency in classical Arabic. English standard verification for fellowship candidates.\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"req-4\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Research Proposal\\\",\\\"number\\\":\\\"04\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"A comprehensive 1500-word draft detailing research questions, targeted texts, and methodologies (Fellows only).\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"req-5\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Letters of Recommendation\\\",\\\"number\\\":\\\"05\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Two signed academic endorsements from accredited departments confirming historical integrity and drive.\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"req-6\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Statement of Purpose\\\",\\\"number\\\":\\\"06\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"A personal letter detailing your academic journey, targets, and reasons for choosing IRITAQ.\\\"}],\\\"steps\\\":[{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Create Account\\\",\\\"stepNumber\\\":\\\"STEP 01\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Register an applicant account on the official portal using verified contact emails.\\\"},{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Fill Forms\\\",\\\"stepNumber\\\":\\\"STEP 02\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Input details, select target courses, and outline previous scholarly backgrounds carefully.\\\"},{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Upload Materials\\\",\\\"stepNumber\\\":\\\"STEP 03\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Submit high-resolution PDFs of ID sheets, official degree transcripts, and references.\\\"},{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Review \\u0026 Pay\\\",\\\"stepNumber\\\":\\\"STEP 04\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Double-check overall details, process the digital administrative fee, and receive confirmation.\\\"}],\\\"deadlines\\\":[{\\\"items\\\":[{\\\"date\\\":\\\"January 01, 2026\\\",\\\"event\\\":\\\"Admissions Open:\\\"},{\\\"date\\\":\\\"February 28, 2026\\\",\\\"event\\\":\\\"Early Action Deadline:\\\"},{\\\"date\\\":\\\"March 15, 2026\\\",\\\"event\\\":\\\"General Deadline:\\\"}],\\\"category\\\":\\\"JANUARY TERM\\\"},{\\\"items\\\":[{\\\"date\\\":\\\"April 1–15, 2026\\\",\\\"event\\\":\\\"Scholarly Interviews:\\\"},{\\\"date\\\":\\